       uummaasskk==_m_a_s_k
           The file mode creation mask is set to _m_a_s_k. The default value of
           mask is 0022. If this option is not specified, then the permissions
           of created user home directory is set to the value of HHOOMMEE__MMOODDEE
           configuration item from /etc/login.defs. If there is no such
           configuration item then the value is computed from the value of
           UUMMAASSKK in the same file. If there is no such configuration option
